{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-gate",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Installation safety gate & data-protection guard for DeepSeek Harness: 49 static signature rules (22 high/23 medium/4 low) scan plugin sources for malicious install scripts, credential theft, obfuscation and network callbacks before 'dsh plugin add', plus 12 destructive-command patterns and workspace-boundary checks against accidental deletion. | 安装安全闸门与数据保护闸：49 条静态签名规则扫描插件恶意行为，12 种危险命令模式与边界检查拦截误删。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./rules": "./lib/rules.js",
    "./scan": "./lib/scan.js",
    "./targz": "./lib/targz.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md",
    "SECURITY.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/",
    "prepublishOnly": "node --test test/"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cordis",
    "plugin",
    "security",
    "scan",
    "audit",
    "malware",
    "supply-chain",
    "gate",
    "safety"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
